<given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Myers</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Robust state-space modeling of animal movement data.</article-title><source>Ecology</source><volume>86</volume><fpage>2874</fpage><lpage>2880</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004711-Nicholls2"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nicholls</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name><name><surname>Robertson</surname><given-names>CJR</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Validating locations from CLS: Argos satellite telemetry.</article-title><source>Notornis</source><volume>54</volume><fpage>121</fpage><lpage>136</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004711-Georges1"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Georges</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name><name><surname>Guinet</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Jouventin</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Weimerskirch</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><year>1997</year><article-title>Satellite tracking of seabirds: interpretation of activity pattern from the frequency of satellite locations.</article-title><source>Ibis</source><volume>139</volume><fpage>403</fpage><lpage>405</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004711-McConnell1"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McConnell</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Chambers</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Fedak</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><year>1992</year><article-title>Foraging ecology of southern elephant seals in relation to the bathymetry and productivity of the Southern Ocean.</article-title><source>Antarctic Science</source><